WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.800
Open Paydesk on the invoices screen.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.800
Type the invoice number in the Invoice number box.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.800
Select Search, and the invoice shows up in the list.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.800
Select the invoice number to open it.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.800
Before approving, check the due date on the invoice.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.800
Select Approve.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.800
Check the supplier and the amount, then select Confirm.
